FID_INPUT_COND_MRKT_DIV_CODE^FID입력조건시장분류코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="1" inout="out" _len="364" _ulen="290" >

FID_OVRS_ISCD^FID해외종목코드^16^0^0^0^0^0^0
FIDX_KOR_ISNM^FIDX한글종목명^65^0^0^0^0^0^0
FID_RLIM^FID비중^9^2^7^0^0^0^0
FID_INPUT_COND_MRKT_DIV_CODE^FID입력조건시장분류코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0
FID_Y1_ERT^FID1년수익률^9^2^7^0^0^0^0
